{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-05-04 08:30:00', 'title': 'S&P DOW JONES INDICES LAUNCHES CRYPTOCURRENCY INDEX SERIES INCLUDING S&P BITCOIN INDEX', 'text': "NEW YORK, MAY 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P DOW JONES INDICES (S&P DJI), THE WORLD'S LEADING INDEX PROVIDER, HAS OFFICIALLY LAUNCHED ITS NEW SERIES OF DIGITAL ASSET BENCHMARKS, THE S&P DIGITAL MARKET INDICES. THESE NEW S&P-BRANDED INDICES WILL MEASURE THE PERFORMANCE OF DIGITAL ASSETS LISTED ON RECOGNIZED OPEN CRYPTOCURRENCY EXCHANGES."}